  "en": "One set of multireference Dirac-Fock orbitals for both parities, then valence correlation to n = 4 for each parity (rcsfinteract with the Dirac-Coulomb-Breit interaction), MCDHF and CI, and E1 transitions between the odd and even levels. The manual's manual step that gives the even levels unique labels (.uni) is not included; the transitions use the original files."
 },
